        "created_at": "2013-04-25T16:24:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry if this has been answered before but I was just checking to see how bounties work against the Ennead. When one of the cards from the shrine is flipped to its incapacited side, does a bounty attached to them stay in play on them or is it put into the trash?</p>",
