        "created_at": "2013-04-25T16:41:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It would be put into the trash and its effects would even take place. So if you put a \"Kill on Sight\" on lets say Isis, and she is reduced to 0 and flipped, the bounty would go into your trash and you can draw 3 cards.</p>",
